# desing

## Feature / Desig 

  
Event Management System is designed to make event planning and management simple and efficient.
✨ Main Features
👤 User Registration & Login
📅 Create and manage events
🔍 Search and view upcoming events
📝 Event registration/booking
📍 Event location details
⏰ Date and time management
👥 Manage attendees/participants
🔔 Notifications and event updates
📊 Event and attendee management

  
## 🎨 Design

  Clean and user-friendly interface
Responsive design for different screen sizes
Simple navigation
Clear event cards with event name, date, time and location
Easy-to-use registration/booking interface
Consistent buttons, colors, fonts and spacing

  
## Goal:

To provide a simple, attractive, and user-friendly platform for creating, managing, and participating in events.
